OL,3,GNEWSAGrave exhumed in probe into 2022
OL,4,Adeath
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have exhumed a grave and
OL,7,Farrested a man on suspicion of muder as
OL,8,Fpart of investigations into the
OL,9,F"unexplained death" of a woman in 2022.
OL,11,FIn the early hours of Monday, the West
OL,12,FMercia force attended Fenns Meadow
OL,13,FGreen Burial Ground near Whitchurch in
OL,14,FShropshire.
OL,16,FIt came after Essex Police received
OL,17,Finformation about the death of a
OL,18,F57-year-old woman in Telford, with the
OL,19,Fdetails passed on to West Mercia
OL,20,Fcolleagues in May.
